 "intro_zh": "千山风景名胜区以峰秀、石峭、谷幽、庙古、佛高、松奇、花盛而著称，历史宗教文化厚重，自然风光神奇瑰丽。千山分为天上天、大佛、五佛顶、桃花溪谷和国家森林公园仙人台五个游览区。",
 "intro_en": "Qianshan Scenic Area is famous for its beautiful peaks, steep rocks, secluded valleys, ancient temples, tall Buddhas, strange pines and abundant flowers. It has rich history, religion and culture, and its natural scenery is magical and magnificent. Qianshan is divided into five tourist areas: Tianshangtian, Big Buddha, Five Buddha Summit, Peach Blossom Valley and National Forest Park Xianren Terrace.",
